cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Nishvasa model code"
message: "If you use this code, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ningoo"
    given-names: "Kunjal Kamal"
    affiliation: "iGEM VIT Vellore 2026 (Team Nishvasa)"
  - name: "iGEM VIT Vellore 2026 (Team Nishvasa)"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kkningoo/nishvasa-model"
abstract: >
  Computational models behind the Nishvasa ammonia scrubber: enzyme
  selection from published kinetics, structural analysis for
  immobilisation, coupled ATP regeneration, and device sizing from bead
  to shed. Organised as four feasibility gates. Includes the parameter
  file with provenance classes and the corrections carried from earlier
  versions.
keywords:
  - enzyme immobilisation
  - ammonia abatement
  - reaction engineering
  - iGEM
